#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 71b257d228f94f8f8b0c7d7eae13c3be
msgid ""
"README: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `4` MOVEJ (canonical); `3` is a **legacy "
"MOVEJ alias** when this controller is standalone, and means **OCS2** on "
"mixed OCS2/WBC stacks"
msgstr ""
"README：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`4` MOVEJ（规范值）；本控制器独立运行时 `3` 是**遗留 MOVEJ "
"别名**，在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: d7ece5e24a50465b8e1f698b6d015661
msgid "[OCS2 Arm Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"
msgstr "[OCS2 Arm Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: aaa1ac9170124bd3b1e5a0fae25c01f1
msgid "HOME / OCS2 / HOLD"
msgstr "HOME / OCS2 / HOLD"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: c463a1a667a94c31b5a319ceeaf94fbc
msgid ""
"README integers: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` **OCS2**. Operators and "
"`ros2_robot_interface` send them on **`/fsm_command`**. Starts in HOLD; "
"OCS2 returns only to HOLD. Shared `FSMCommandPublisher` also defines `4` "
"MOVEJ"
msgstr ""
"README 整数：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` **OCS2**。操作员和 `ros2_robot_interface` 发到 "
"**`/fsm_command`**。从 HOLD 起步；OCS2 只能回到 HOLD。共用的 `FSMCommandPublisher` "
"还定义了 `4` MOVEJ"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 8c31fbc810b74c1086de068472bdccc1
msgid "[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)"
msgstr "[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 3d8c529297954bd5a7c3ac4814337349
msgid "全身 stack"
msgstr "全身栈"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 06fd3c15ff0344f6aae67c4a9be8d06d
msgid ""
"Binary in `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control`. Extra states are in the source "
"README. Public Python still uses the same `/fsm_command` integers plus "
"`/mode_command` strings"
msgstr ""
"二进制在 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 里。多出来的状态写在源码 README。公开的 Python 仍使用同一组 "
"`/fsm_command` 整数，外加 `/mode_command` 字符串。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:39
#: 95f65e3579074beb9d92712a4d8cfd9c
msgid ""
"On mixed stacks, head / split-waist `basic_joint_controller` treats **`3`"
" and `4` as MOVEJ**, while the arm / WBC controller treats **`3` as "
"OCS2** and **`4` as MOVEJ**."
msgstr ""
"混合栈上，头部 / 分体腰部的 `basic_joint_controller` 把 **`3` 和 `4` 都当作 MOVEJ**；手臂 / "
"WBC 控制器则把 **`3` 当作 OCS2**、**`4` 当作 MOVEJ**。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:41
#: 8191fe12096e415f82f821907f0697b7
msgid ""
"The [ocs2_arm_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)"
" still names `/control_input` for those 1/2/3 integers. That is **not** "
"the stack-wide FSM topic. Joystick `control_input` "
"(`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`) on `arms_target_manager` is a different"
" message: it is scaled into `/left_target/twist` / `/right_target/twist`."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)"
" 仍把 1/2/3 这些整数写在 `/control_input` 上。那**不是**全栈 FSM "
"话题。`arms_target_manager` 上的手柄 "
"`control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）是另一种消息：按比例映射到 "
"`/left_target/twist` / `/right_target/twist`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:43
#: 09699dd8f4114c238e527810a5b82e80
msgid "ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # HOLD"
msgstr "ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # HOLD"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:47
#: 2752b9d8151340f898e67bd5b1bb9d93
msgid ""
"Split vs whole-body launches (and the Lift2S `quick_start` **split body**"
" / **full body** menu) are on [分体控制 vs 全身控制](7-split_vs_wbc.md). Teleop "
"is a separate interface, not an extra FSM state — [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"分体 vs 全身 launch（以及 Lift2S `quick_start` 的 **分体** / **全身** 菜单）见 [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](7-split_vs_wbc.md)。遥操作是另一套接口，不是额外 FSM "
"状态——[同构遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

