#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:94
#: 34393623c34e4a9b854e507c710bace2
msgid ""
"`/body_target*`, `/head_target*`, `/mode_command`, and `WbcCurrentState` "
"(`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`) need **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** and"
" that robot’s 全身 launch/config (`full_body.launch.py` when the controller"
" type is `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`). Default mock demos "
"(`demo.launch.py`) and 分体 (`split_body.launch.py`) do **not** imply these"
" features are present."
msgstr ""
"`/body_target*`、`/head_target*`、`/mode_command` 以及 "
"`WbcCurrentState`（`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`）需要 "
"**`ocs2_wbc_controller`** 以及该机型的全身启动/配置（控制器类型为 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` 时用 `full_body.launch.py`）。默认 mock"
" 演示（`demo.launch.py`）和分体（`split_body.launch.py`）**并不表示**这些能力可用。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:96
#: 0a6395170a704e5281ae7b992f4138ff
msgid ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` runs from the `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb. "
"Extra FSM states stay in the source README. Which constraints are live "
"depends on the robot (`WbcCapability` in the [msgs "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md):"
" mobile base, body relative, head 6D, midpoint gaze, …). Public Taku mock"
" uses `split_body.launch.py robot:=taku` (arm MPC + body/head "
"`basic_joint_controller` + `adaptive_gripper_controller`). That is not "
"WBC. `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` needs `ocs2_wbc_controller` from "
"that deb or from a source checkout. Shipping "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` in the public description is not "
"enough. When that config and the controller are installed, Taku full-body"
" default `headMode` is `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze on "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`); `target_manager.yaml` has "
"`enable_head_control: false` so the head follows OCS2 rather than a "
"joint-space marker. Split-body still teleops the head through "
"`head_joint_controller`. Taku body-relative rest is around x≈−0.21, not "
"Bot2 `[0, 0.25]`. Head 6D tracking (`HEAD_TRACKING`) is only there when "
"the controller reports `head_tracking_ee_enabled`."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` 从 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 这个 deb 运行。多出来的 FSM "
"状态留在源码 README。哪些约束在生效取决于这台机器人（[消息 README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)"
" 里的 `WbcCapability`：移动底盘、身体相对、头部 6D、中点注视等）。公开的 Taku mock 用 "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`（手臂 MPC + 身体/头部 "
"`basic_joint_controller` + `adaptive_gripper_controller`）。那不是 "
"WBC。`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` 需要这个 deb 里的 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`，或一份源码检出。公开描述里带 `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` "
"不够。配置和控制器都装上之后，Taku 全身模式默认 `headMode` 是 `HEAD_GAZE`（注视 "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`）；`target_manager.yaml` 里 "
"`enable_head_control: false`，头跟随 OCS2，而不是关节空间里的标记。分体模式仍通过 "
"`head_joint_controller` 遥操作头部。Taku 相对身体的静止位置大约在 x≈−0.21，不是 Bot2 的 `[0, "
"0.25]`。头部 6D 跟踪（`HEAD_TRACKING`）只在控制器报告 `head_tracking_ee_enabled` 时才有。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:99
#: 748e8985858f4e5990df3ae750258aa5
#, #
msgid ""
"These Cartesian body topics are on the **全身 / WBC** path "
"(`full_body.launch.py`, `body_target_enabled`). **分体** "
"(`split_body.launch.py`) drives the waist with "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" joint topics (`/body_joint_controller/target_joint_position`, …), not "
"this set."
msgstr ""
"这些身体笛卡尔话题走**全身 / WBC** "
"路径（`full_body.launch.py`，`body_target_enabled`）。**分体**（`split_body.launch.py`）用"
" "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" 的关节话题驱动腰部（`/body_joint_controller/target_joint_position` 等），不是这组话题。"

