#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:257
#: 75833615797a43d2ac0833e892e829bf
msgid ""
"Head modes are mutually exclusive, and they are independent of the body "
"mode. `head_midpoint_gaze_active` is not a separate command; it becomes "
"`true` only after `HEAD_GAZE` is active. Send `HEAD_DISABLE` to stop "
"gaze."
msgstr ""
"头部模式彼此互斥，并且独立于身体模式。`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 不是一条单独的命令；它只在 `HEAD_GAZE` "
"生效后才会变成 `true`。发送 `HEAD_DISABLE` 可停止注视。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 05b7e100dc9546f798fd708e6f55b20d
msgid "`HEAD_DISABLE`"
msgstr "`HEAD_DISABLE`"

