"`false`"
msgstr "`head_state` = `0`（`HEAD_DISABLED`），`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 为 `false`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 830d48af779548c9acb04b7ee277b940
