#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 25d29e503d94491fb1a51345df688398
msgid ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`, from the top-level `headMidpointGaze` "
"section (`activate`, `cameraFrame`, and the camera parameters). This "
"reports an active task, not that the head is already aligned or that the "
"target is reachable."
msgstr ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`，来自顶层 `headMidpointGaze` "
"段（`activate`、`cameraFrame` 以及相机参数）。这表示任务已激活，不表示头部已经对准，也不表示目标可达。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
