"From the msgs README. Default **arm** action names on "
"`ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig` point at `ocs2_arm_controller`; override the "
"config if the controller has a namespace. Waist action name is auto-"
"detected (`/ocs2_wbc_controller/waist_lifting_pose` or "
"`/body_joint_controller/waist_lifting_pose`)."
msgstr ""
"来自 msgs README。`ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig` 上默认的**手臂** Action 名指向 "
"`ocs2_arm_controller`；控制器带命名空间时请覆盖配置。腰部 Action "
"名会自动检测（`/ocs2_wbc_controller/waist_lifting_pose` 或 "
"`/body_joint_controller/waist_lifting_pose`）。"

