#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:336
#: c6a42d7d8da742a9ba4a0b232eca8f05
msgid ""
"Python: `execute_movel_action`, `execute_movec_action_three_point` / "
"`execute_movec_action_parametric`, `execute_joint_trajectory_action` / "
"`execute_dual_arm_movej_action`, "
"`execute_waist_lifting_pose_absolute_action` / "
"`execute_waist_lifting_pose_relative_action`. These block until a result "
"or timeout. The matching topics (`*/stamped`, `target_joint_trajectory`, "
"`waist_lifting_pose_*`) have **no** result."
