#~ msgid ""
#~ "Poses are `geometry_msgs/Pose` (no `header`),"
#~ " in the robot world frame (`x` "
#~ "forward, `y` left, `z` up). WebXR "
#~ "publishes on a fixed 30 Hz timer."
#~ " XRoboToolkit publishes when the VR "
#~ "`timeStampNs` changes: about 90 Hz with"
#~ " the default Pico App, and about "
#~ "400 Hz with the enterprise send "
#~ "rate over USB."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "位姿是 `geometry_msgs/Pose`（没有 `header`），在机器人世界系（`x` "
#~ "向前、`y` 向左、`z` 向上）。WebXR 用固定 30 Hz "
#~ "定时器发布。XRoboToolkit 在 VR `timeStampNs` 变化时发布：默认"
#~ " Pico App 大约 90 Hz，企业发送速率走 USB "
#~ "时大约 400 Hz。"

#~ msgid ""
