#~ " every frame. The press edge is "
#~ "a separate code on `/teleop/controller_state`"
#~ " (`9` left, `10` right)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "行程深度每帧都在 `/teleop/trigger_values`。按下边沿是 "
#~ "`/teleop/controller_state` 上的另一个码（左 `9`，右 `10`）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`VRInputHandler` in `arms_target_manager` subscribes"
#~ " to the pose topics, "
#~ "`/teleop/controller_state`, `/teleop/thumbstick_axes`, and"
#~ " `/teleop/trigger_values`. In UPDATE it "
#~ "drives arm targets from the controller"
#~ " poses. Grippers that are in percent"
#~ " mode follow `trigger_values`. The latched"
#~ " mode is `teleop/mode_state` (`TeleopModeState`)."
#~ " Headset button behavior: {ref}`VR "
#~ "Teleoperation <controller-buttons>`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`arms_target_manager` 里的 `VRInputHandler` "
#~ "订阅位姿话题、`/teleop/controller_state`、`/teleop/thumbstick_axes` 和"
#~ " `/teleop/trigger_values`。UPDATE 时它用手柄位姿驱动手臂目标。百分比模式的夹爪跟随 "
#~ "`trigger_values`。锁存模式是 "
#~ "`teleop/mode_state`（`TeleopModeState`）。头显按键：{ref}`VR 遥操作 "
#~ "<controller-buttons>`。"

